<title>USA: Angola buys 17,850 tonnes PL 480 HRW wheat.</title>
<headline>Angola buys 17,850 tonnes PL 480 HRW wheat.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Angola bought 17,850 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat under the PL 480 export donation program, the U.S. Department of Agriculture said.</p>
<p>The wheat was acquired from Cargill at $180.10 a tonne, FOB U.S. Gulf.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for October 10-October 25.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
